    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The single decision that lets content published to a STATIC url ever
      be updated: whether a\n cache entry found by url is also current for the version
      the requester asked for.\n\n \n\nReturns true (keep using the cache) whenever
      no version was declared, which is the\n branch taken by every bundle and client
      that predates versioning \u2014 so this is a no-op for\n existing content."
