    Summary: "The single opaque tag stored against cached bytes. ETag wins because
      it tracks content\n exactly; Last-Modified only has one-second resolution and
      would miss an edit republished\n within the same second, so it is the fallback.
      Prefixed so the two are never confused\n and a stored tag can be turned back
      into the right conditional header."
