      registration.\n \n\nRemoval must use this rather than recomputing from the
      loadable bundle: the key\n includes the content version tag, and that tag lives
      on a record other systems hold and\n write to. A recomputed key that has drifted
      removes nothing, leaving a dead or orphaned\n wrapper in the registry under
      its original key."
