    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Covers load reservation pairing. A release has to find the wrapper
      the reservation was actually\n taken on: the registry key carries the content
      version tag, and other systems write that tag\n onto the record after the load
      has already reserved against it. A release that recomputes the\n key from the
      drifted record decrements whichever wrapper it lands on, and that wrapper can
      then\n reach zero and unload assets its own live instances are still built
      from."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
