    Summary: "Tries to get an existing cache entry, dropping it if the Avatar asset
      it describes has been\n destroyed \u2014 which happens when the bundle it came
      from is unloaded, and is also what makes\n a reused entity id safe (the previous
      owner is destroyed, so the entry fails this check and\n is rebuilt for the
      new asset)."
