    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Drops every entry whose Avatar asset has been destroyed. TryGet only
      evicts\n an entry that something looks up again, so without this a session
      that cycles through many\n avatars keeps every dead one \u2014 and an entry
      now owns the shared hand-pose grid's native\n memory, which no GC will ever
      reclaim."
