  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Avatar.BasisTrackerRoleOverride
    MemberName: BasisTrackerRoleOverride
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Per-tracker forced-role table, keyed by Device_Management.Devices.BasisInput.UniqueDeviceIdentifier.\n
      When an override is set, the constellation classifier in\n BasisAvatarIKStageCalibration
      binds the tracker straight to\n the chosen role at calibration time and never
      scores it against any\n prior \u2014 the user has told us where the tracker
      lives, so discovery is\n pointless.\n\n Persisted as JSON next to the pairing
      file so a one-time setup survives\n restarts. Symmetric with BasisTrackerPairing
      in shape \u2014 the\n two stores are independent (a tracker can be paired AND
      have its role\n forced; the override applies to the merged virtual midpoint
      via either\n half's id)."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
