    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Offer the performance preset before a connection to a server whose
      probe reported a\n crowd. `prospectiveOccupants` is the reported online count
      plus the\n joining local player, matching the occupant semantics of the post-join
      watcher.\n Returns true when a prompt was shown and the connection is deferred
      \u2014 every choice in\n the prompt (including closing it unanswered) then
      runs `continueConnect`,\n so the click on Connect is never silently swallowed.
      Returns false when nothing needs\n asking and the caller should just connect."
    Remarks: 
