    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Shared accent tinting for panel elements \u2014 used to show at a glance
      that a control is in a\n raised state (Performance Mode is cutting, a volume
      is boosted past normal, and so on).\n\n \n\nThe element's own colours are captured
      once up front and every tint is a blend toward\n the accent, so the styling
      the prefab shipped with is never lost and clearing always lands\n back exactly
      where it started. Transitions run through the tween system."
    Remarks: 
