    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Re-loads a settings class's bindings once the settings file has been
      read. Binding\n constructors self-load, but static init triggered from any
      RuntimeInitializeOnLoadMethod\n runs before BasisSettingsSystem.Initialize
      (a Start hook) \u2014 those bindings only ever see\n defaults: saved values
      restore into the store but never into RawValue. Package settings\n classes
      (which the framework's BasisSettingsDefaults.LoadAll can't know about) register\n
      here from their static constructor."
    Remarks: 
