  - TypeFullName: Basis.BasisUI.BasisSizeFitter
    MemberName: BasisSizeFitter
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: ContentSizeFitter
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "ContentSizeFitter variant that can floor its fitted size at the parent
      rect's width\n (both axes compare against the parent WIDTH \u2014 long-standing
      behaviour other layouts\n depend on). Unlike the stock fitter it computes the
      final size first and writes it once,\n only when it actually changed: the stock
      write-then-correct pattern re-dirtied the canvas\n on every rebuild and looped
      through DelayedSetDirty whenever the parent was larger than\n the content."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
