    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Blanks the results table ahead of a solve. Rows accumulate across every
      slot that shares a\n target, so they have to start from nothing.\n\n Its own
      job rather than a preamble inside the solve: it depends on nothing the sample\n
      produces, so it runs alongside that instead of behind it, and a solve split
      across groups\n could not do it anyway \u2014 a group blanking the whole table
      would wipe rows another group had\n already solved."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
