    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "URP renderer feature that draws an outline + glow around any renderer\n
      registered with BasisHighlightManager.\n\n Pipeline: mask \u2192 separable
      dilation (defines the ring) \u2192 optional\n separable gaussian (softens the
      dilated field into a glow halo) \u2192\n composite over camera color.\n\n All
      tunables live on a shared BasisHighlightSettings\n ScriptableObject so Desktop
      and Quest renderers can point at the same\n configuration without duplicate
      values."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
