  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.BasisSdk.Highlight.BasisHighlightPass
    MemberName: BasisHighlightPass
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: ScriptableRenderPass
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "RenderGraph pass implementation for BasisHighlight:\n   1. Mask    
      \u2014 draw every active renderer with its override material into\n                
      a half-res R8 silhouette texture.\n   2. Dilate   \u2014 separable H/V max
      filter that grows the silhouette by N\n                 pixels. (dilated \u2212
      raw) is the outline ring; because max\n                 filtering produces
      a constant-thickness band, the ring\n                 exactly follows the contour,
      including concave corners\n                 (no gaussian iso-line \"skipping\"
      across nub junctions).\n   3. Glow     \u2014 optional separable gaussian on
      the dilated mask, used as\n                 the soft halo trailing outward
      from the silhouette.\n   4. Composite \u2014 combine raw, dilated, and glow
      into a ring + halo and\n                 alpha-blend over camera color."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
