    Summary: "Collider references used for range checks and interaction.\n If set
      to a non-empty array, these colliders will be used as the interactable's colliders.\n
      If empty or null, and a non-trigger collider exists on the same GameObject,
      that GameObject's colliders will be used.\n If empty or null, and the GameObject
      has only triggers or no collider at all, all child colliders will be used."
