    Summary: "Resolves the collider set and caches each collider's owning GameObject
      alongside it, so the\n per-frame range and closest-point queries never allocate
      or walk back to the GameObject\n through native interop. Runs at Awake; call
      again after adding or removing\n colliders at runtime. Toggling a collider
      or its GameObject does not need a refresh \u2014\n that is checked live per
      query."
