    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Optional authored grip: the transform on this object that should coincide
      with the player's hand while\n it is held. When set, a welded hand grab seats
      the object so this transform lands on the palm with the\n hand's orientation
      \u2014 the only way an object can arrive the right way up, since without it
      a grab can\n pull the nearest collider surface in but has nothing to say about
      which way the object should point.\n Ignored for desktop holds, whose follow
      frame is the view rather than a hand."
