    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Watches the live server link so the player is never left staring at
      a frozen world while\n the transport silently counts down to its disconnect
      timeout. Owns the loading bar for the\n connect handshake, for a stalled link,
      and for the reconnect countdown, and re-issues the\n connection automatically
      when the failure came from the server side rather than the user.\n Ticked once
      per frame from the event driver; every entry point is main-thread only."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
