      (or the '*' wildcard),\n which exempts them from the admin-controlled avatar-scale
      clamp, playspace-mover lockout, and\n direct-connect lockout. Mirrors the server's
      permission check; direct connect is still gated\n server-side, so this is just
      UI/UX for that one."
