      is on. Mirrors the server's own check exactly (basis.chat.lockbypass, or the
      '*' wildcard) \u2014\n this gate is cosmetic, the server drops the message
      either way, so the two must agree or a\n bypass holder would see a greyed-out
      composer that would in fact have worked."
