    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Client-side manager for networked PIP cameras.\n Fully static - driven
      by BasisLocalPlayer.AfterSimulateOnLate via Simulate().\n Smoothing (IJobParallelFor)
      plus camera and owner-nameplate transform writes\n (IJobParallelForTransform)
      all run Burst-compiled off the main thread. Each spawned\n camera and nameplate
      is an independent scene root so the transform writes spread\n across worker
      threads instead of serializing on a shared hierarchy."
    Remarks: 
