    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Registers the LiteNetLib server-info probe with BasisNetworkStackRegistry.\n
      Fires a single unconnected \"server info\" packet at the listening port (the
      LiteNetLib\n equivalent of a Minecraft Server List Ping) and awaits the response.\n\n
      When the hostname resolves to both AAAA and A records, IPv6 is attempted first
      with\n half the total timeout budget. If IPv6 times out or fails the probe
      falls through to\n IPv4 with the remaining budget. The winning IPAddress is
      stored in\n ServerProbeResult.ResolvedAddress so callers can connect directly
      to the\n confirmed-reachable address family without re-resolving DNS."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
