    Summary: "Content that started loading and never arrived. Kept because nothing
      else records it:\n a spawn only reaches the registry once its bundle is live,
      so a bundle that 404s (or\n has no build for this platform) leaves no row anywhere
      \u2014 while the server keeps handing\n the same spawn to every joiner, and
      a persistent one comes back every session, with no\n UI to remove it from."
    Remarks: 
