    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Far avatars for remote players whose real avatar isn't loaded: a ~20-bone,
      ~8k-triangle\n proxy baked into the bee connector, built at runtime as a REAL
      BasisAvatar\n (see BasisFarAvatarBuilder) and installed through the exact same
      pipeline as\n every other avatar. Loading avatar, bundle avatar, glTF avatar
      and far avatar are all the\n same thing to the rest of the system \u2014 avatars
      are swapped, never hidden or disabled.\n\n The far avatar lives PAST the max
      avatar range slider: inside avatar range the real\n avatar always shows; beyond
      it the range system unloads the real avatar and the far\n avatar replaces the
      loading dummy. It also fronts the player while their real avatar\n downloads,
      has no build for this platform, or failed to load."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
