  - TypeFullName: ConnectorFetch
    MemberName: ConnectorFetch
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 1
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Connector fetches shared per bee URL: N wearers of one avatar await
      ONE ranged\n download instead of racing N tasks through the gate. The old per-player
      fetches each\n started a 30s budget that also covered the QUEUE \u2014 in a
      same-avatar lobby everyone\n past the first gate-width waited out their budget
      behind identical downloads and got\n cancelled. Completed successes stay cached
      so later wearers capture instantly;\n failures are evicted so the tick's per-player
      backoff retries with a fresh fetch.\n Main-thread access only."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
