    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The one download per bee URL. Never throws \u2014 a null connector
      means failure, logged\n once here instead of once per wearer. The 30s timeout
      is created fresh PER ATTEMPT\n and only after the gate slot is held, so neither
      our queue nor a retry burns it (the\n \"Cancelled before starting\" wave was
      the old shared budget expiring while queued).\n Transient failures (network
      blips, timeouts) retry once in place before deferring to\n the tick's backoff;
      fatal ones (corrupt bee) stop immediately."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
