  - TypeFullName: BasisAvatarShadowLOD
    MemberName: BasisAvatarShadowLOD
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Distance-based suppression of shadow casting on remote avatars. Nothing
      in Basis has ever\n written Renderer.shadowCastingMode on a remote renderer,
      so every avatar in the\n instance casts into the shadow map at any distance
      \u2014 a full extra skinned draw per shadow\n cascade, per avatar. Past a dozen
      metres that shadow is a handful of pixels.\n\n Rides the mesh LOD level BasisDistanceJobParallel
      already computes, so it adds no\n distance work of its own and only reacts
      when a remote crosses a LOD boundary."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
