    Summary: "Snapshots the authored Renderer.shadowCastingMode of every renderer
      on the\n avatar. Must be called at avatar load, before any reduction is applied,
      and must be the only\n source of restore values: authors deliberately use ShadowCastingMode.Off
      and\n ShadowCastingMode.ShadowsOnly, so blanket-restoring to\n ShadowCastingMode.On
      would light up shadow-proxy meshes that are supposed to be\n invisible."
