    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Distance-based reduction of how many bone influences are blended per
      vertex when skinning a\n remote avatar. Remote SkinnedMeshRenderers are left
      on SkinQuality.Auto, which\n resolves to the project quality level's skin weights
      (Unlimited), so every vertex of every\n distant avatar is skinned against its
      full influence set. Past a few metres the difference\n between four influences
      and one is not resolvable, so the extra weights are pure cost.\n\n This rides
      the mesh LOD level that BasisDistanceJobParallel already computes, so\n it
      costs no extra distance work \u2014 it only reacts when a remote crosses a
      LOD boundary."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
