    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 1
    Summary: "The persisted seatedmode setting must be re-applied once the local
      player actually exists:\n the boot settings replay can reach this module BEFORE
      the player/HMD are ready, which either\n half-applied seated mode (flag set
      with a ZERO lift \u2014 the seated eye poll had no device and\n fell back to
      the same value the delta subtracts) or missed entirely if the module woke after\n
      the replay. Either way the mode selection wasn't restored between sessions."
    Remarks: 
