  - TypeFullName: BasisFarAvatarBuilder
    MemberName: BasisFarAvatarBuilder
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Builds a far avatar as a REAL BasisAvatar from the\n BasisFarLodPayload
      carried in the bee connector: a runtime skeleton, a\n humanoid rig rebuilt
      with AvatarBuilder (the same way generic glTF avatars\n are rebuilt), and a
      shared low-poly skinned mesh. The result installs through the exact\n same
      factory/calibration/registration pipeline as every other avatar \u2014 loading
      avatar,\n bundle avatar, glTF avatar and far avatar are all the same thing
      to the rest of the\n system. Nothing is ever hidden or disabled; swapping representations
      swaps the avatar.\n\n Mesh, texture, material and humanoid rig are shared per
      avatar version across every\n player wearing it; only the ~20-transform skeleton
      is per player."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
