  - TypeFullName: 
    MemberName: TryInstall
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - remote.IsDestroyed
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Builds this player's far avatar and installs it as their current avatar
      through the\n normal factory path (old avatar deleted, remote calibration,
      bone-job registration).\n Non-blocking: a version whose shared assets exist
      installs within this call; a first\n wearer kicks the payload parse to a worker
      thread and returns false \u2014 the caller keeps\n whatever is worn and retries
      once the parse lands. Returns false with the payload\n marked unusable when
      it refuses to build, so there is no retry spam."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
