  - TypeFullName: 
    MemberName: PrewarmParse
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - remote.IsDestroyed
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Starts the worker-thread payload parse for this player's resolved far
      avatar version\n WITHOUT installing anything. Installs are transmit-tick-only:
      CreateAvatar and the\n load error path run on IO/task continuations, where
      the remote-bone and jiggle\n pipelines can have scheduled-but-unjoined jobs
      \u2014 an install there mutates their\n TransformAccessArrays mid-flight (the
      flung-skeleton / Invalid-AABB class). Callers\n keep the current avatar worn;
      the tick's TryInstall swaps at the safe\n point once the parse lands."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
