    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Promotes this descriptor's subtree onto its own nested Canvas so geometry\n
      changes inside it (live stats, meters) only re-batch this group, not the whole
      open menu.\n Pair with FreezeLayoutSize on the live fields: freeze stops the
      per-tick\n reflow, the nested canvas stops the per-tick batch rebuild reaching
      the root canvas.\n Inherits the parent canvas's shader channels so TMP renders
      identically; Basis input is\n collider + per-canvas GraphicRegistry based,
      so nested children stay interactive without\n an extra GraphicRaycaster."
    Remarks: 
