    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Lightweight vertical virtualized list. Attach to a ScrollRect (or let
      the\n static helper do it for you) and supply a row factory plus a bind delegate.\n
      Only enough rows to cover the viewport (+ a small buffer) are ever created,\n
      and scrolling rebinds existing rows to new data indices instead of\n instantiating
      new ones.\n\n Typical usage:\n   var descriptor = PanelElementDescriptor.CreateNew(ScrollViewVertical,
      parent);\n   var list = PanelVirtualScrollList.AttachTo(descriptor, rowHeight:
      90f);\n   list.SetDataSource(\n       count: items.Count,\n       createRow:
      content => PanelButton.CreateNew(content).transform as RectTransform,\n      
      bindRow:   (row, i) => row.GetComponent<PanelButton>().Descriptor.SetTitle(items[i]));"
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
