    Summary: "The Reset button. With a page reset registered this is a fork \u2014
      put the panel back where\n it was, put the page's settings back to defaults,
      or both \u2014 so it asks rather than\n guessing. The panel's Close button
      is the way out that resets nothing, so every button\n in the dialogue itself
      resets something and dismissing it must not be captured as a\n pending notification
      whose dismiss would fire the decline callback."
