    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Remembers where the user dragged each provider panel. The stored value
      is a delta from the\n position the provider authored for that panel, not an
      absolute placement, so a later change\n to a provider's default still lands
      and the user's nudge is applied on top of it.\n \n\n\n Desktop and VR keep
      separate deltas. The menu sits at a different distance and scale in each\n
      mode, and only VR can push a panel along Z at all, so a single shared value
      would drag a\n placement made in one mode into the other where it never belonged."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
