      the visual where it\n was \u2014 it never writes the underlying Slider/Dropdown
      \u2014 so the default would apply without\n the control visibly moving. SetValueWithoutNotify
      moves it without re-firing the live\n listener; the binding and callback are
      then invoked explicitly."
