    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Staged-edit tracker for one settings section that commits through an
      Apply button.\n\n \n\nEach control is registered alongside the live value it
      mirrors. While any control\n differs from its live value the section card and
      its header tint toward\n BasisPanelTint.Caution and the header gains an \"unsaved\"
      suffix, so an admin\n can see which sections still need an Apply without scrolling
      through them. Because dirty is\n derived from a comparison rather than a latch,
      editing a field back to its original value\n clears the tint on its own, and
      so does the server echoing the value the Apply just sent."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
