      destroyed when it\n collapses, so nothing is paid for a section the user never
      opens and the rows re-read\n live state every time it is reopened. Use this
      instead of\n CreateCollapsibleFlatSection for sections that are expensive to
      build or\n that snapshot runtime data. `buildContent` adds its rows to\n `container`
      as usual; they are moved directly beneath the header."
