    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Single compute-and-write pass for all avatars' authored movements.
      One movement touches only\n a few transforms, so a single IJobParallelForTransform
      parallelises cleanly\n across avatars (no compute/apply split like the 51-bone
      skeleton needs). Every kind is a delta\n from the captured rest pose. All math
      is `Unity.Mathematics`, so the routine is Burst-legal."
