    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "A degenerate quaternion assigned through a TransformAccess skips the
      main-thread validation\n Unity applies to transform.localRotation, and normalizing
      a zero quaternion when the matrix\n is composed produces a NaN world matrix
      for the transform and everything under it. Movement\n data is avatar-authored,
      so it cannot be assumed unit-length."
