    ParamDocs:
    - List the created collider is appended to.
    - Transform that defines the collider's transform and space.
    - "Radius in world metres. Stored pre-divided by the bone's average scale, because\n
      JiggleCollider.Read multiplies it back each frame \u2014 bone lossyScale is
      arbitrary rig data,\n not a measure of rendered size, so passing it through
      unscaled made the world radius depend\n on how the armature happened to be
      authored. Default is `0.005`."
