  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Drivers.BasisHandPoseGrid
    MemberName: IsCreated
    Kind: Property
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "True only for a grid that is actually samplable. The array being allocated
      is not enough:\n a zero-length or single-column grid reports IsCreated on the
      NativeArray while every\n sample indexes out of bounds, and the sampler's clamp
      range (0 .. gridWidth - 2) inverts\n below two columns. Burst turns that into
      an abort rather than an exception, so the check\n belongs here where every
      caller already looks."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
