    Summary: "Fills `target` with the grid for `animator`'s avatar,\n restoring from
      BasisAvatarModelCache when it is already baked and baking\n (then storing)
      when it is not.\n\n The cache is keyed on the Avatar ASSET, so a crowd wearing
      the same avatar bakes once \u2014\n which matters because a bake instantiates
      a hidden duplicate and runs 441 SetHumanPose\n calls, and remote players now
      need this too."
