    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Expands ten curl/splay pairs into the thirty finger joint rotations,
      writing them into\n `boneRotations` at the wire slots the finger joints occupy.\n\n
      The values written are this rig's LOCAL rotations, not generic-space ones.
      The receiver\n pairs this with identity decode operators on those slots, so
      the compose job's\n `DecodePre * value * DecodePost` passes them through untouched
      \u2014 which avoids a\n generic-space round trip that would only ever undo
      itself."
    Remarks: 
