    Summary: "Burst-compiled job that processes one ordered chain of bones.\n Each
      bone's compute mirrors `BasisLocalBoneControl.ComputeMovementLocal`.\n The
      chain is processed serially within the job; multiple chain jobs may run\n concurrently
      as long as they write to disjoint indices and depend on any chain\n whose outputs
      they read (target lookups across chains)."
    Remarks: 
