    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Leading frames that exist only to converge filter state, and whose
      solved output must NOT be\n measured. This is the other half of the determinism
      story: the BONE POSE is never carried\n between frames, but FILTER STATE always
      is, so a replay that begins mid-stream \u2014 or that\n measures before the
      filters have caught up \u2014 produces a different, wrong answer. Model both
      or\n the temporal behaviour is fiction."
    Remarks: 
