    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Raised once per rendered frame from `BasisEventDriver`'s before-render
      pass, after the\n local player's render-time simulation has settled the camera
      and head. The late-latch slot:\n the camera pose statics (Position, HeadPosition,
      the eye\n vectors) are final here, and nothing has been drawn yet.\n\n Anything
      writing a transform that must not trail the head by a frame belongs here rather\n
      than in `LateUpdate`. It runs with the whole render waiting on it, so keep
      handlers\n short. Does not fire on a headless client, which never renders."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
