    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Optional external world pose for the audio listener. When set and it
      returns a\n value, the listener is driven there instead of tracking the player's
      head \u2014 a\n handheld camera uses it to make the world be heard from the
      camera's viewpoint.\n Returning null defers to the normal head/camera logic.\n
      \n\n\n Only one AudioListener exists per scene, so this moves the real listener
      rather\n than adding another; the last provider to set it wins, and it must
      be cleared when\n the source goes away or the listener would stay stuck at
      a dead pose."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
