  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.BasisCharacterController.
    MemberName: LocomotionSpeedScale
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - Mathf.Sqrt(AvatarSizeRatio()
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Locomotion speed multiplier. Gait is modelled on the Froude number
      v/sqrt(g*L) and every step\n parameter is derived from the avatar's own leg,
      but movement speed was a fixed m/s \u2014 so a small\n avatar's v-hat inflated
      by 1/sqrt(scale), pinning speedScale and urgencyT at maximum and roughly\n
      doubling step cadence at half size. Scaling speed by sqrt(ratio) holds v-hat
      constant, so cadence,\n bob, sway and double-support all match at every size
      (0.5x size keeps 71% of speed, not 50%)."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
