  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Drivers.
    MemberName: RegisterAvatarWithBoneJobSystem
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 2
    ParamNames:
    - RemotePlayer
    - '!receiver.BoneDecodePost.IsCreated'
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "(Re)registers the real avatar's transforms with the bone job system.
      Split out of\n RemoteCalibration so the far LOD swap can restore the registration\n
      without a full recalibration. With `snapToNetworkPose` the avatar is\n also
      snapped onto the latest network pose (scale, derived root, hips world) and
      the\n jiggle rigs are teleported by the travel delta \u2014 used when the avatar
      wakes back up\n after the far LOD hid it."
    Remarks: 
