    Summary: "The avatar root's lossy scale divided by its own localScale \u2014
      i.e. everything the parent\n chain contributes, which is invariant while the
      avatar lives. The network drives the root's\n localScale, so the root's world
      scale is `networkScale \xD7 this`. Baked instead of read\n back off the localToWorldMatrix
      each frame, which was GatherRootJob's only live output."
