      transforms, computes derived\n joint positions, and writes a RemoteFrameOutput.
      Reads no transforms \u2014 every input\n is produced by BulkCopyHipsAndDeriveJob,
      which fans out the network's hips pose and scale and\n forward-kinematics the
      head off them. Folds in the SoA\u2192AoS aggregation step, so the whole\n pre-apply
      chain is one dependency deep."
