  - TypeFullName: 
    MemberName: Schedule
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - (!sInitialized
    ParamDocs:
    - "Upper cap on `innerloopBatchCount` for the per-avatar IJobParallelFor.\n The
      actual batch is `min(maxBatchSize, ceil(AuthoringLength / workerCount))`\n
      so the job spreads across all worker threads instead of running on one."
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Schedules the entire simulation pipeline for the current set of avatars:\n
      derive \u2192 simulate \u2192 apply (nameplate/mouth/hips/skeleton). There
      is no gather stage \u2014 every\n input is either network state or a rig constant
      baked at registration."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: The final JobHandle for dependency chaining.
    Value: 
