    Summary: "Pure remote-avatar bone math shared by BasisRemoteBoneJob and the editor
      Remote Bone sweep, so\n the sweep exercises the real forward-kinematics chain
      rather than a copy. The head chain (neck \u2192\n chest \u2192 spine, plus
      derived eye/mouth) is FK off the networked head pose and the scaled T-pose\n
      offsets \u2014 each child is parent + headRotation * scaledOffset."
    Remarks: 
