  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Networking.Sync.Testing.BasisSyncSim
    MemberName: BasisSyncSim
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Offline, deterministic exerciser for the generic value-sync data path\n
      (BasisSyncCodec + BasisSyncReceiver).\n\n It runs the real serialize \u2192
      wire \u2192 deserialize \u2192 interpolate pipeline without a live\n network
      or a MonoBehaviour: a faithful re-implementation of the owner send cadence\n
      (mirrors `BasisSyncedObject.TransmitIfDue` / `FieldChanged`) drives the real
      codec;\n a seeded packet network injects loss / duplication / reorder / jitter
      / corruption; the real\n BasisSyncReceiver plays it back; and a managed copy
      of\n `InterpolateSyncObjectsJob` samples the output. Every run is reproducible
      from its seed,\n so the result CSV is stable.\n\n Out of scope (timing/transport,
      not data correctness): distance reduction, relevance culling,\n P2P routing,
      recipient filtering. Those don't change what comes out of the codec/receiver."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
