      work\n (deserialize the client packet, wrap in ServerAudioSegmentMessage, serialize
      once \u2014\n mirroring `BasisServerHandleEvents.HandleVoiceMessage`/`SendVoiceMessageToClients`),\n
      then applies seeded downlink impairments. The uplink leg is kept clean so stated\n
      loss/jitter numbers act on exactly one leg."
