  - TypeFullName: Basis.IK.
    MemberName: Simulate
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - (!_initialized
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Runs after the device poll and BEFORE BasisLocalBoneDriver.Simulate
      in the\n local player tick: the bone sim's follower chains (untracked legs/arms
      hang off the hips\n via TargetIndex) must read the hips this solve writes for
      the SAME frame, or the whole\n virtual leg chain \u2014 toes included \u2014
      trails the torso by a frame. The eye pose is read\n from the control's freshly
      polled IncomingData (the sim has not published it yet), so\n the head target
      is still this frame's pose."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
