  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.BasisSdk.Interactions.BasisJiggleGrabDriver
    MemberName: BasisJiggleGrabDriver
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Grab-and-pull for jiggle chains. Holds every grab announced in the
      session (a small\n event-driven dictionary), applies only those whose target
      tree is simulated locally,\n and pushes hand-space pin targets into the jiggle
      sim once per frame. Ticked by\n BasisEventDriver from the frame-sync window,
      right before JigglePhysics.DispatchSimulate,\n so remote skeletons and local
      IK are posed and targets land the same frame."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
