  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.BasisSdk.Interactions.
    MemberName: TryGetLocalPlayerId
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - id
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Our own network id. Must go through BasisNetworkConnection.TryGetLocalPlayerID:\n
      that reads the peer's RemoteId, which is the id the SERVER assigned us. NetPeer.Id
      is the\n local peer-list index of our connection to the server \u2014 effectively
      always 0 on a client,\n so using it made us collide with whichever player the
      server numbered 0, and every\n \"is this me?\" test in here silently answered
      yes for that player."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
