    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The span a closing hand sweeps: palm to fingertip. People grab with
      their fingers, so a\n strand lying across them should be takeable while one
      floating behind the knuckles is\n not \u2014 a sphere on the palm gets both
      of those wrong. Falls back to a short span along the\n hand when the avatar
      has no finger bones."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
