  - TypeFullName: Basis.Network.Core.Compression.BasisBlendShapePacking
    MemberName: BasisBlendShapePacking
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Delta-compressed blendshape encoding/decoding shared between client
      and server.\n Wire format:\n   Byte 0 - Header: [7:6] Mode (00=Sparse, 01=Dense,
      10=Silent) | [5] Keyframe | [4:0] Reserved\n   Byte 1 - Count of synced blendshapes
      (0-255)\n   Sparse: [bitmask: ceil(N/8) bytes] [changed values: 8-bit quantized]\n  
      Dense:  [all values: N bytes, 8-bit quantized]\n   Silent: no additional bytes\n\n
      Quantization: Unity weight [0,100] \u2192 byte [0,255] (~0.4% precision, visually
      indistinguishable)\n Only face-tracking blendshapes are synced. Viseme/blink/laughter
      are excluded\n because they are reconstructed remotely by OpenLipSync and BasisRemoteFaceManagement."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
