  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Networking.Compression.
    MemberName: CompressHipsDelta
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 3
    ParamNames:
    - delta
    - buffer
    - offset
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Encodes a hips local-position delta (vs TPose) as 3 signed 13-bit axes
      clamped to\n \xB1BasisAvatarBitPacking.HipsDeltaRange metres, packed into\n
      BasisAvatarBitPacking.WriteHipsDelta bytes \u2014 it rides in the avatar\n
      packet tail so seated/IK hips overrides reach remotes. Two's complement, so
      a\n zero-byte tail (e.g. from a test client that doesn't fill the field) decodes
      to zero\n delta rather than a clamped extreme.\n\n Takes this namespace's own
      `float3`\n (Basis.Scripts.Networking.Compression.float3) \u2014 kept as a\n
      plain POD struct so the wire layer doesn't drag a Unity.Mathematics\n dependency
      into server-side callers. Unity-side callers convert from\n Unity.Mathematics.float3
      at the call site."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
