  - TypeFullName: BasisNetworkHandleAvatarDelta
    MemberName: BasisNetworkHandleAvatarDelta
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Decodes one avatar delta on BasisNetworkCommons.DeltaAvatarChannel
      \u2014 server-repacked\n (any quality) or straight from a P2P peer (High) \u2014
      reconstructs the full pose payload against the\n player's last keyframe baseline,
      and feeds the result through the same decode path as a keyframe.\n Keyframes
      (and P2P full frames) still arrive on the per-quality avatar channels and are
      handled by\n BasisNetworkHandleAvatar. Control frames (header bit 7) carry
      keyframe requests.\n\n Wire (must match BasisServerReductionSystemEvents.PreSerializeDelta
      and the P2P splice in\n BasisP2PManager.BroadcastAvatarViaP2P):\n   [header:1][playerId:1|2][interval:1][sequence:1][baseSeq:1][delta
      body][additional?]\n header bits: quality(2) | hasAdditional<<2 | largeId<<3
      | control<<7."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
