      using\n BasisNetworkCommons.EventType_JiggleGrab.\n\n The grab itself never
      streams: every client derives the pull from the grabber's\n already-synced
      hand pose. Start doubles as a periodic keepalive/late-join heal,\n Stop ends
      a grab, and Deny is sent by the grab TARGET to kill a grab everywhere\n (the
      both-ways block enforcement)."
