    Summary: "Hop-by-hop counters for AdditionalAvatarData (face tracking, avatar
      behaviour params)\n across the avatar sync pipeline. Counting is always on
      (a few Interlocked adds per\n avatar frame); read live via the Basis \u25B8
      Debug \u25B8 Additional Data editor window.\n\n Sender hops:   Submitted (behaviour
      \u2192 transmitter) \u2192 Attached (Compress put it on a frame).\n Receiver
      hops: Parsed (frame carried a section) \u2192 gate results \u2192 Dispatched
      (behaviour ran)."
    Remarks: 
