    Summary: "Unity-side wrappers around BasisBoneRotationCompression (which is pure
      C#).\n Bridges quaternion/NativeArray types to the server-compatible encode/decode.\n\n
      Since v47 the rotation region is two regions: explicit smallest-three rotations
      for wire\n slots 0..20, then ten curl/splay finger channels. Slots 21..50 of
      the pose still exist \u2014\n they are just reconstructed from the channels
      through the receiver's own pose grid rather\n than transmitted."
