    Summary: "Reads this bone's rest frame \u2014 TposeFromRoot's rotation re-expressed
      in the avatar's own\n anatomical basis (see GetCharacterBasis), which is what
      makes the value on\n the wire mean the same thing on a rig that was authored
      differently.\n\n Falls back to identity when the rig lacks the bone or calibration
      never recorded it.\n RecordPoses stores absent bones as an all-zero BasisCalibratedCoords,
      which is not a\n rotation \u2014 Normalize inside the operator builders turns
      that into identity, but resolve\n it here too so callers that inspect the frame
      directly see the same value."
