      i set = effector i anchored).\n An effector is anchored only when the sender's
      own copy is genuinely world-stable (a held\n controller/tracker or a planted
      foot) \u2014 otherwise FK is left alone so emotes/poses survive.\n Returns
      0 (inert) until the per-effector rig seams are wired; see CaptureEndEffectors
      below."
