    Summary: "DEPRECATED compatibility shim \u2014 do not add this to new content.\n
      The networked pickup is now BasisPickupSyncNetworking (it was moved into the
      framework\n and renamed). Legacy content bundles serialized their pickup component
      as \"BasisObjectSyncNetworking\"\n in this (BasisExamples) assembly, so this
      concrete subclass lets that old content resolve to a real\n type and behave
      as a modern synced pickup instead of coming in as a missing script."
