  - TypeFullName: BasisPickupSyncNetworking
    MemberName: AttachToHandOnGrab
    Kind: Field
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "While a player holds this prop, stop streaming its world transform
      and instead stream which\n hand holds it plus the hand-relative grab offset
      (the difference between the holding hand bone and the\n prop). Every remote
      re-parents the prop to its own copy of the owner's hand bone each frame, so
      the\n prop stays glued to the hand with no position-interpolation lag and near-zero
      traffic while held.\n On release it snaps back to normal transform sync. On
      by default; set false for plain world-position streaming while held."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
