    Summary: "The grip an authored BasisPickupInteractable.GripPoint defines, solved
      locally from this\n receiver's own copy of the prefab. Nothing about it travels:
      both ends run the same solve against the\n same authored transform, so the
      held pose carries no measurement noise, no interpolation lag and no\n trace
      of the holder's rig. False when the sender did not flag an authored grip, or
      when this copy of\n the prop has none \u2014 in which case the streamed offset
      is used instead."
