    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Owner only. Metres between the prop's real pose and the pose rebuilt
      from the values just written\n into the sync channels. Non-zero means the encode
      itself is lossy on this prefab \u2014 the usual cause\n is a position or rotation
      axis left unsynced on the component, which silently drops that component\n
      of the grip offset. Everything downstream inherits it, so nothing else can
      be trusted until it is 0."
    Remarks: 
