    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Multiplier applied to SharedOpusSettings.DesiredDurationInSeconds\n
      when sizing newly-allocated AudioClips. Acts as a secondary\n playback buffer
      between the decoded PCM queue and Unity's AudioSource;\n smaller = lower latency
      but tighter coupling to underrun, larger = more\n memory + more headroom. Existing
      pooled clips keep their original size,\n so callers should Clear the pool after
      lowering this if\n they want the change to take effect immediately on next
      Get."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
