    Summary: "Sets the adaptive jitter depth parameters from a single user-facing
      \"target depth\"\n value. Initial matches target so cold starts don't overshoot
      into the slowdown\n branch; Max caps the underrun growth at target+2 but never
      below 4 so we still\n have room to react to unstable networks. Leaves the lock
      off, so depth still adapts."
