    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Grows the lazily-initialized region to include `playerId` on the\n
      main thread. BeginWrite only covers [0, LargestNetworkReceiverID+1), and that\n
      high-water is recomputed at the tail of LateUpdate \u2014 AFTER RemoteBoneJobSystem.Schedule()\n
      reads these slots earlier in the same LateUpdate. A remote whose avatar calibrates
      within\n a frame of joining (cached/fallback avatars) registers a key the driver
      hasn't covered\n yet, so the bone-copy jobs read uninitialized NativeArray
      memory and emit a NaN pose.\n Call this at calibration, before the player is
      registered with RemoteBoneJobSystem.\n Completes any in-flight oneEuroJob first
      (same reason as SeedScaleState): EnsureInitialized\n writes arrays the job
      touches."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
