    Summary: "Overrides the filtered hips world position and rotation for a player
      so that\n the combined BulkCopyHipsAndDeriveJob (and thus ApplyRootAndScaleJob
      /\n ApplyHipsWorldJob) pick up the override instead of the interpolated network\n
      data. Position/Rotation in the pipeline are hips world (not root world) \u2014\n
      the override therefore teleports the visually anchored hips, and root is\n
      derived from there.\n Must be called after Apply() and before Schedule()."
