    Summary: "Burst two-bone IK for anchored remote limbs. One work item per dense
      player; per anchored effector\n it reads the FK-posed shoulder/elbow/wrist
      world (from the read-pose pass), reconstructs the sent\n world target from
      the applied hips + hips-local offset, solves, and writes the resulting LOCAL\n
      rotations for upper/lower/tip into the override buffer. The upper's parent
      world is derived from\n its own read world \xD7 inverse(local), so no rig-specific
      parent bone lookup is needed."
