      start.\n 22 was enough while the curve flattened at the critical distance and
      only the\n near field had to be fitted; with the inverse distance law running
      the whole\n way out there is far more dynamic range to cover, and 22 drifted
      0.72 dB at a\n 0.1 m / 25 m combination."
