    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Re-arm the initial-fill gate so TryConsumeEncoded waits for\n InitialBufferDepth
      packets again before releasing playback.\n Called by the receiver when it detects
      the sender has been idle long enough\n (e.g. mic muted) that the pipeline has
      fully drained \u2014 without this, the\n first post-resume packet would be
      released with only 20 ms of audio queued\n and any arrival jitter on the next
      packet would underrun.\n Keeps `_started` and `_nextPlaybackSeq` as-is: the
      sender's\n sequence number is continuous across its mute, so playback resumes
      from\n where it left off."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
