  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Networking.Sync.
    MemberName: IdleKeyframesExhausted
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 4
    ParamNames:
    - idleCount
    - maxShift
    - atCapCount
    - maxAtCap
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "True once an idle owner has delivered the whole backoff ladder plus
      `maxAtCap`\n keyframes at the capped interval. Keyframes are reliable, so remotes
      hold the converged state\n without further re-sends; late joiners are covered
      by OnPlayerJoined (forced keyframe/snapshot)\n and any change resets both counters."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
