    Summary: "Writes an arbitrary pose into the enabled position / rotation / scale
      channels (owner side),\n honouring the configured axis toggles, rotation mode
      and scale mode. Exposed so a subclass can\n stream a remapped pose \u2014 e.g.
      a hand-relative offset \u2014 through the same channels that\n OnBeforeTransmit
      normally fills from the Target. Values are written verbatim (no\n WorldSpace
      / RelativeTo handling); ComposeSyncedPose returns them unchanged when\n every
      position axis is synced, which is the decode side a subclass pairs with this."
