    Summary: "Decodes the interpolated pose for the enabled axes (in WorldSpace or
      local space, matching\n transmit); a partially-synced channel holds the Target's
      live value on its unsynced axes. Live transform\n reads only happen for those
      partial channels \u2014 when nothing scale-related is synced, s is Vector3.one\n
      (gate applying it on HasSyncedScale). Subclasses can use this to drive something
      other\n than the Target transform \u2014 e.g. a Rigidbody with prediction +
      correction."
