  - TypeFullName: BasisDirectionalDampenJob
    MemberName: BasisDirectionalDampenJob
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: IJobParallelFor
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Burst parallel job: computes the per-player spatial voice terms \u2014
      the\n listener cone-of-influence attenuation, and the two high-shelf depths
      that\n carry the frequency-dependent half of the model (talker mouth directivity,\n
      and the listener's own head shadowing whoever is behind them).\n\n Reads targetPositions/targetForwards
      (shared [ReadOnly] with the distance\n job) so it can run fully in parallel
      with distance, reduce, and cap jobs.\n Output goes to NativeArrays; the caller
      copies to the managed\n AudioReceiverModule in a trivial main-thread loop.\n\n
      The cone is split into a broadband term and a shelf term rather than being
      a\n single fader: see `BasisVoiceAcoustics.ListenerConeTerms` for why, and\n
      for the guarantee that the two together still attenuate by exactly what the\n
      user's dampening slider asks for."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
