    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Opaque content-version tag for the bee at URL \u2014 see\n BasisRemoteEncyptedBundle.RemoteVersionTag.
      Lets a wearer say \"same url, new bytes\" so\n receivers can invalidate their
      cache for content published to a static address.\n \n\nAppended after the original
      two-field format shipped. Receivers must tolerate its\n absence (see DecodeFromBytes),
      and the server stores this payload as an\n opaque blob, so the tag reaches
      late joiners with no server-side change."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
