      reload disabled the\n statics survive exiting play mode, so the persistent
      arrays would both leak and be handed\n to the next session. Enabled is assigned
      directly rather than through\n SetEnabled because the database has just been
      torn down with it \u2014 there are\n no renderers left to restore."
