    Summary: "Covers the name-based version grouping the library falls back to when
      content carries no\n authored ContentGroupId \u2014 i.e. everything built before
      that field existed, which is exactly\n the content creators have been re-uploading
      by hand as \"My Avatar v2\".\n\n \n\nIt is a heuristic over creator-chosen
      text, so the cases that matter most are the ones\n where it must NOT fire:
      a name that merely ends in a digit-bearing word, and a name that\n would be
      left empty by stripping."
