    Summary: "Covers how a prop's spawn placement is decided, for every value of\n
      BasisPropSpawnPlacement.\n\n \n\nOnly the resolution half is exercised here.
      `PropSpawnPlacement.ComputePose` reads\n `BasisLocalCameraDriver`/`BasisLocalPlayer.Instance`,
      casts a physics ray and calls\n native `Quaternion` methods, none of which
      exist in an EditMode run without a live player\n rig \u2014 so the pose maths
      is verified in-app, not here."
