    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Full registration-time measurement: crown estimate \u2192 hips-relative
      height \u2192 model units.\n\n The divide is the same conversion `BasisRemoteBoneMath.HeadAnchorOffset`
      makes for\n the eye/mouth anchors: the inputs are rendered metres (the root's
      scale baked in), the\n solve multiplies by the root's LIVE scale every frame,
      so what gets stored has to be\n model units or a networked resize would apply
      the avatar's scale twice."
