    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "True once IKWorldData carries a pose that was really published. Two
      different\n nothings have to be told apart here: a live store before its first
      solve leaves the rotation\n all-zero, but a TORN-DOWN store makes the getter
      answer BasisCalibratedCoords.Identity,\n whose (0,0,0,1) rotation passes any
      \"not all zero\" test \u2014 so a consumer testing the value alone\n treats
      a dead store as a valid pose at the world origin and follows the bone there."
