    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "TMP_InputField character filter for the BEE URL box. A double quote
      is never legal\n unencoded in a URL or a Windows path, so one arriving can
      only have come from a wrapped\n paste \u2014 drop it as it lands rather than
      leaving the user staring at a field that looks\n right and refuses to load.
      This only covers in-place editing (typing, Ctrl+V); the virtual\n keyboard's
      paste assigns `.text` directly, which TMP does not run through this, so\n StripSurroundingQuotes
      is what guarantees the quotes are gone by validation."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
