    MemberName: SplitUrlFragmentPassword
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 4
    ParamNames:
    - rawUrl
    - rawPassword
    - url
    - string.Empty).Trim(
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Splits an optional `url#base64password` fragment off the URL. If the\n
      caller passed a non-empty `rawPassword`, that takes\n precedence over the fragment;
      otherwise the fragment is base64-decoded into\n the returned password. Used
      by both the in-game add dialog and the admin\n \"default library\" add path
      so the two stay in lockstep.\n \n\nWrapping quotes come off before the fragment
      is split, so a trailing quote on a\n pasted `\"url#pass\"` share string does
      not end up corrupting the base64 decode."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
