    Summary: "Performance Mode block at the head of the Graphics page: the level
      itself, whether it\n follows the instance population on its own, and a line
      naming the population tiers.\n The section is tinted by the active level so
      the page shows at a glance how hard the\n mode is cutting. Changing the level
      rewrites the settings the rest of this page shows,\n so the page is reopened
      afterwards the same way the reset button does it."
