    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Identity (DID) card, shared by the General and Developer tabs.\n The
      user's DID/UUID is the long-lived id the server keys ban,\n permission, and
      content-share entries against. We render it through\n PanelPasswordField so
      the value is masked by default and the user\n has to tap the eye icon to reveal
      \u2014 same UX as a server password.\n Read-only because DIDs are persisted
      to PlayerPrefs and rotated\n through BasisDIDAuthIdentityClient, not edited
      inline."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
