    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Screen-center aim reticle owned by BasisDesktopEye. Quad\n prefab parented
      to the local camera, drawn with the always-on-top\n `Custom/DesktopReticleOverlay`
      shader. Three concentric bands\n (dot, dark gap, outer ring) keep it visible
      against most backgrounds.\n\n Visibility is gated by two independent inputs.
      User setting\n (SetEnabled) and cursor focus (SetFocused,\n off while the cursor
      is unlocked). Quad is shown only when\n both are true."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
