    Summary: "The exact per-frame fusion BasisVirtualMidpointInput runs: a confidence-weighted
      position\n blend with a continuous pull toward the calibrated rest distance,
      a rest-offset-projected rotation slerp,\n and a rotation low-pass. Pulled out
      of the MonoBehaviour so the offline temporal sweep drives the\n identical stateful
      math frame-by-frame with no scene or play mode."
