    Summary: "Pure rotation math for fusing two rigidly-linked tracker rotations
      into a single\n midpoint orientation. Lives apart from BasisVirtualMidpointInput
      (a\n MonoBehaviour wired to live devices and settings) so the offline multi-tracker\n
      rotation sweep can exercise the exact math the live pair runs, with no scene."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
