    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Reprojection must agree with capture under a drag: snapshots taken
      while dragged (offset baked\n into BOTH the tracker and its paired head anchor,
      as BasisInput.CalculateOffset stores them)\n must rebuild the same inverse
      offset as an in-place calibration \u2014 including at a different\n DeviceScale,
      which is reprojection's whole job (avatar swap / scale slider after calibrating)."
