    Summary: "The height the player types in is the most trusted number in the pipeline,
      so the parser has to\n take it however they think about their own height and
      never silently misread it. The dangerous\n failures are the quiet ones: reading
      \"5'10\" as five metres, or \"178\" as 178 metres, would poison\n every measurement
      that then gets validated against it."
