    Summary: "Measures the per-frame cost of the constraint system at the scale a
      busy instance actually\n reaches, rather than reasoning about it. Reports numbers
      and asserts almost nothing \u2014 a\n benchmark that fails on a threshold just
      becomes a flaky test on someone else's machine.\n\n Numbers here run in the
      editor, so they are not what a player build sees. What they are good\n for
      is the ratio between two arrangements measured back to back on the same machine."
