    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Replay of avatar-channel (ch15) messages that were deferred for a not-yet-loaded
      avatar and\n drained by BasisNetworkReceiver.OnCalibration. The queued messageIndex
      was\n validated against the PREVIOUS avatar's behaviour array, so the avatar
      that actually lands\n can be shorter \u2014 most often the fallback from a
      failed download, which has none at all.\n Throwing out of the drain aborts
      RemoteCalibration and the factory destroys the avatar,\n so a stale index or
      a misbehaving content behaviour must never escape."
