  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.Sync.
    MemberName: GenericSpace_PreservesRotationAngle
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - RndQ(
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Conjugation is an isometry of SO(3), so the generic value has exactly
      the rotation\n ANGLE the local delta had. That is the whole reason BPC_HIGH,
      MAX_COMPONENT, the\n deadband thresholds and the packet size all carried over
      untouched: only the axis\n changed frame, never the magnitude. If this breaks,
      every per-joint range in\n BasisBoneRotationCompression is silently mis-sized."
    Remarks: 
