    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The wire format changed meaning without changing shape \u2014 same
      fields, same bits, same\n bytes \u2014 so a v45 peer and a v46 peer would happily
      parse each other's packets and both\n render nonsense. Only the version gate
      stops that, which makes the bump part of the\n change rather than bookkeeping
      alongside it."
