  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.Sync.BasisHandPoseGridCostTests
    MemberName: BasisHandPoseGridCostTests
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "What the grid costs to build and to sample.\n\n This matters because
      v47 moved the bake onto the REMOTE avatar load path. It was previously\n paid
      once, for the local player, during calibration; now every distinct avatar in
      the\n instance pays it. A bake instantiates a hidden duplicate of the rig and
      runs 441\n SetHumanPose calls, so \"how bad is that\" stopped being rhetorical.\n\n
      The ceilings are deliberately loose. A wall-clock assertion tight enough to
      be interesting\n would flake on a loaded CI machine, so these only catch a
      catastrophic regression \u2014 an\n accidental per-cell allocation, a bake
      that stopped hitting the cache \u2014 while the logged\n figures carry the
      actual signal for anyone reading the run."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
