  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.Sync.BasisPickupWeldMatrixTests
    MemberName: BasisPickupWeldMatrixTests
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: BasisPickupWeldFixture
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "A sweep of the space a welded hold can go wrong in, rather than a list
      of the bugs already found.\n\n The invariant under test is always the same
      one: the prop must end up in the same place relative to\n the observer's own
      hand frame as it is relative to the holder's. Because the reconstruction is
      a\n change of coordinates, that invariant holds for any pair of frames the
      two ends agree on and fails\n for any pair they do not \u2014 so sweeping hands,
      rigs, hand sizes, grips, ids and lifetime events is a\n direct search for disagreement,
      and a case that passes here cannot misplace a prop in a session.\n\n Cases
      the reconstruction legitimately cannot serve (an observer that cannot build
      the sender's frame)\n assert the honest outcome instead: the prop holds its
      last pose rather than moving somewhere wrong."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
