    Summary: "Reference-frame tests for the attach-to-hand pickup path.\n\n BasisPickupAttachTests
      injects a synthetic offset with EncodePose and decodes it against the SAME\n
      hand transform, so it validates the algebra but cannot see a mismatch between
      the wrist the owner\n measured against and the wrist the observer reconstructs.
      These tests drive the real\n OnBeforeTransmit measurement on an owner rig and
      decode on a SEPARATE observer rig - the way two\n clients actually work - to
      find which link puts a held prop out of the hand on remotes."
    Remarks: 
