  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.Sync.BasisRemoteInterpolationTests
    MemberName: BasisRemoteInterpolationTests
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Locks the remote-avatar playback interpolation (BasisRemoteInterpolationCore):\n
      the Catmull-Rom spline that replaced linear-nlerp + the heavy per-bone 1\u20AC
      filter.\n\n Guards the properties the fix depends on:\n   - the spline passes
      through the network snapshots (no bias),\n   - it is C1 at snapshot boundaries
      (kills the velocity corner = the wobble source),\n   - it survives the codec's
      sign canonicalization (no long-way whole-body flip),\n   - duplicated endpoints
      (startup / packet-loss underrun) stay bounded and finite,\n   - and, through
      the REAL bone codec, cubic tracks a moving joint markedly better\n     than
      the old linear path."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
