    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Guards the single-datagram budget that keeps an oversized sync packet
      from throwing\n TooBigPacketException out of the transport \u2014 a throw that
      unwinds through\n BasisSyncDriver.TransmitOwned into BasisEventDriver.LateUpdateBody
      and takes every later\n LateUpdate stage with it, including the interpolation-job
      join.\n\n The runtime escalation itself (BasisSyncedObject.TransmitIfDue swapping
      an over-budget\n packet onto ReliableUnordered) is not covered here for the
      same reason the send cadence\n isn't: driving TransmitIfDue through a send
      lands in BasisNetworkGenericMessages and needs a\n live transport. What IS
      covered is every pure input that decision is made from."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
