    Summary: "Coverage for the bit-packed codec and per-component quantization: Raw
      is bit-exact, Half and\n Ranged stay within their resolution, Ranged clips
      out of range, bools cost one bit, mixed-mode\n fields survive keyframe + delta,
      smaller bit widths produce smaller packets, and decoding a\n truncated/corrupt
      buffer never throws."
