  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.Sync.BasisSyncReductionTests
    MemberName: BasisSyncReductionTests
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Distance/relevance reduction, which decides how fast each locally-owned
      object sends and\n (when culling) who it sends to. This used to run per object
      inside TransmitIfDue, walking\n the whole receiver snapshot; it is now one
      batched Burst pass over every owned object.\n\n Covered here: the job's nearest-observer
      math, the relevance bitmask (including the two\n cases that are easy to get
      wrong \u2014 a radius of exactly zero, and stale bits surviving from\n a previous
      pass), mask indexing past the 64-player word boundary, parity against a plain\n
      managed reference implementation, parallel-write disjointness, the mask-to-player-id\n
      expansion, and the sentinel contract between BasisSyncedObject and the job."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
