    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Regression for visemes dying after an avatar swap: the driver subscribes
      TryShutdown to the\n face renderer's DestroyCalled, and the OUTGOING avatar's
      BasisMeshRendererCheck stays alive\n until its end-of-frame destroy \u2014
      which lands AFTER the incoming avatar has re-initialized the\n shared per-player
      driver. The stale notification cleared WasSuccessful, and ProcessAudioSamples\n
      gates on it, so the new avatar's mouth never moved again until the next avatar
      change."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
