    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Drives a steady sine through the shaper and returns the settled\n gain
      in dB, as the ratio of output to input RMS over the final block.\n RMS rather
      than peak: at 6 kHz there are only eight samples per cycle, so\n the filter's
      phase shift moves the true peak off the sample grid and a\n peak reading under-reports
      by up to 0.7 dB."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
