      and foot rotation each used to own a pair of \"Start (record)\" /\n \"Stop
      + Dump CSV\" menu entries \u2014 six entries for three recorders that behave
      identically.\n They are one list here: enter Play, start the one you need,
      reproduce the misbehaviour, stop.\n Each dumps a CSV next to the other sweep
