      Every sweep used to be its own EditorWindow with its own menu entry \u2014
      three dozen entries under\n Basis \u25B8 Debug \u25B8 IK that were the same
      window with different knobs. They are pages now: the host\n owns the chrome
      (title, description, scrolling, output path) and each page only draws its own\n
      configuration and results. Pages are discovered by TypeCache, so adding one
      is\n still just adding a file."
