      map of the\n local player's main-thread Transform work \u2014 every row is
      a place the main thread reached into\n native transform state, and therefore
      a place that can stall on in-flight transform jobs.\n\n A site missing from
      this list either did not run or was never migrated to the funnel; the list
      is\n coverage, not proof of completeness."
