    Summary: "Reports the dependency graph behind the current Addressable entries
      so groups\n can be planned without duplicating shared assets. Any dependency
      that is not\n itself addressable is copied into every bundle that references
      it; this flags\n the ones spanning multiple groups (the duplication hotspots)
      and writes a\n shareable report to the project root. Sizes are best-effort:
      assets in\n immutable packages (Library/PackageCache) may show 0."
    Remarks: 
