    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Organizes Basis Addressable groups for memory. Moves self-contained
      clusters into\n their own group via path rules (gizmos, fonts), then isolates
      every dependency shared\n across 2+ groups into a shared bundle (fonts -> \"Basis
      Fonts\", the rest -> \"Basis Shared\")\n so it is referenced once instead of
      copied into each bundle. Editor-only and script\n assets are ignored. Idempotent;
      run the Dependency Report afterwards to verify."
