  - TypeFullName: BasisBeeAvatarPreviewTab
    MemberName: BasisBeeAvatarPreviewTab
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: BasisEditorTabPage
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 1
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Loads a final .BEE file and previews the avatar's two fallback representations:
      the\n far avatar carried on the connector, and the Generic (glTF) avatar section.
      Both are\n decoded exactly the way a client decodes them \u2014 the far avatar
      through\n BasisFarLodPayload's builders, the generic avatar through a real
      glTFast\n import of the decrypted section \u2014 so what renders here is what
      remote players get on a\n platform without a purpose-built AssetBundle.\n\n
      Reads both bee layouts: the SDK export (8-byte header, all sections) and the
      on-disk\n cache (4-byte header, single section). The password auto-fills from
      the\n \"dontuploadmepassword.txt\" the SDK writes next to the exported bee."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
