    Summary: "Where the frame went, in one window.\n\n Markers is the raw profiler-marker
      table \u2014 anything the engine or a Basis subsystem instruments,\n discovered
      automatically. EventDriver is the hand-instrumented breakdown of the central
      tick,\n which knows about the stalls and the counts a marker name can't tell
      you. They answer the same\n question at two altitudes, so they share a header
      and a recording session instead of being two\n windows kept open side by side."
