    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The Generic (glTF) avatar fallback imports GLBs at runtime; glTFast
      resolves its\n materials via Shader.Find, which only sees shaders compiled
      into the player. Nothing in\n the project references the glTFast shader graphs
      directly, so without this they get\n stripped and every generic avatar renders
      with the error shader. Adding them to\n GraphicsSettings' Always Included Shaders
      before each player build keeps them available."
