    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Runtime debug-gizmo drawing. The Create/Update/Destroy id API is retained
      so callers\n can hold onto gizmos across frames, but the backend is batched:
      spheres and lines are\n plain data slots submitted once per frame as a handful
      of draws \u2014 instanced meshes for\n spheres, one dynamic ribbon mesh per
      layer for the lines \u2014 so cost scales with visible\n geometry instead of
      GameObject count. Text labels stay TextMeshPro objects (pooled),\n and only
      the MaxVisibleLabels nearest the viewer render at once, which\n bounds the
      TMP re-tessellation cost regardless of how many labels exist.\n Render must
      run once per frame; SMModuleDebugOptions.Simulate drives it."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
