    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Torso lean/twist/roll from PoseLandmarker world landmarks. Rotation
      only \u2014 the world landmarks are\n HIP-CENTRED, so they carry no global
      translation to read a sway out of even if we wanted one; a body\n shift shows
      up as the shoulders moving over the hips, which is a lean, and is already captured
      here.\n\n Reads the same body frame the arms retarget against and reports how
      far it has turned from a calibrated\n neutral. What comes out is an OFFSET,
      not a chest orientation \u2014 the caller composes it onto the avatar's\n own
      body so the chest keeps following the body and only picks up your torso on
      top."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
