  - TypeFullName: Basis.MediaPipe.
    MemberName: TryPalmFrame
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 6
    ParamNames:
    - wrist
    - indexMcp
    - middleMcp
    - pinkyMcp
    - left
    - '!IsFinite(pinkyMcp)'
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Palm frame: forward runs wrist to middle knuckle, up is the palm normal.
      The index/pinky\n ordering mirrors between hands, so the normal is negated
      on the left to give both hands the same\n \"out of the back of the hand\" convention.\n\n
      Called with MediaPipe landmarks for the user and with humanoid bone positions
      for the avatar, so\n both palm frames are defined by the same rule and mapping
      between them is a change of basis."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
