    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Palm frame from the BODY pose alone. The pose model carries a wrist,
      an index knuckle and a pinky\n knuckle per hand, which is enough for a coarse
      palm frame in the same space as the body frame \u2014 so\n the wrist still
      rotates with the body when the hand landmarker has nothing to say."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
