  - TypeFullName: Basis.MediaPipe.Tests.
    MemberName: ElbowIsKinematicallyReachable
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - _)
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The elbow must be a pose the avatar's own bones can actually reach:
      exactly an upper-arm from the\n shoulder AND exactly a forearm from the wrist.
      Scaling the measured elbow straight through (as this\n used to) satisfies neither,
