    Summary: "Raised on enable/disable so a registered motion system can flip this
      component's slice\n of its valid-mask without a per-frame poll. The system
      subscribes at registration; the\n component holds no reference to any toggle
      package, so any actuator that flips\n Behaviour.enabled (e.g. an HVR.Vixxy
      activation) drives it unchanged."
