  - TypeFullName: BasisGenericAvatarData
    MemberName: BasisGenericAvatarData
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Everything needed to reconstruct a functional BasisAvatar from the\n
      platform-agnostic Generic (glTF binary) bundle section. glTF carries meshes,
      materials,\n skinning and blendshapes, but has no concept of Unity's humanoid
      rig or Basis's avatar\n wiring (visemes, eye/mouth positions), so that data
      is captured at SDK build time from the\n authored avatar and rides as JSON
      on BasisBundleGenerated.GenericAvatarDataJson\n inside the encrypted connector.
      At runtime, after the GLB is imported, this rebuilds the\n humanoid Avatar
      via `AvatarBuilder.BuildHumanAvatar` and rewires the BasisAvatar.\n Bone and
      node references are by transform name/path, which is why the exporter must
      make\n transform names unique before capture."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
