    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Lets a transform lag behind its source instead of following it rigidly
      \u2014 the floppy secondary\n motion on ears, tails, straps and the like. The
      Basis stand-in for Animation Rigging's\n `DampedTransform`.\n\n The damp values
      read as resistance, matching Unity: 0 snaps straight onto the source, 1 never\n
      moves at all. Motion is integrated in fixed 60Hz sub-steps, so the lag looks
      the same\n regardless of framerate."
    Remarks: 
