    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Keeps a set of transforms in the same arrangement relative to each
      other, with one of them\n leading. The Basis stand-in for Animation Rigging's
      `MultiReferentialConstraint`.\n\n Which member leads is driver, and it can
      change at runtime: the offsets are\n derived from the poses captured at bind
      rather than from wherever things happen to be, so\n handing leadership to a
      different member is just a different index \u2014 no rebuild, no drift, and\n
      the same arrangement either way."
    Remarks: 
