    Summary: "Replaces a transform's pose with an override \u2014 either explicit
      values or the first source's\n movement since its bind was captured. The Basis
      stand-in for Animation Rigging's\n `OverrideTransform`.\n\n Unlike the other
      kinds this blends away from the transform's current pose rather than\n its
      rest pose, matching Animation Rigging: an override layers on top of whatever
      posed the\n transform this frame instead of fighting it. BasisConstraintBase.weight
      still\n scales the whole effect, and the per-channel weights scale position
      and rotation separately."
    Remarks: 
