  - TypeFullName: BasisLoadableBundle
    MemberName: ReservedWrapperKey
    Kind: Field
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Registry key of the wrapper this bundle's load reservation was taken
      on. Stamped by\n BasisLoadHandler when the reservation is taken and consumed
      when it is released.\n \n\nThe release must not re-derive the key from this
      record: the key includes the\n content version tag, and other systems write
      that tag here after the load has already\n reserved (LibraryProvider stamps
      the cached tag onto the bundle a player holds). A\n drifted key either finds
      nothing \u2014 the reservation leaks and the bundle never unloads \u2014\n
      or silently decrements a DIFFERENT wrapper that aliases the same AssetBundle,
      which can\n then hit zero and Unload(true) the meshes and humanoid rig its
      own live avatars are\n still driven with."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
