    Summary: "Bakes an AnimationClip's rotation curves into a BasisMotionClip for
      a\n `Sequence` movement. Samples the clip at a fixed rate onto an in-scene
      root (via\n AnimationMode, which restores the pose afterwards) and records
      each animated bone's\n absolute local rotation. Paths are stored relative to
      the chosen root, so set the same root on the\n Sequence movement. Rotation
      only in v1 \u2014 position/scale curves are ignored."
