      OPAQUE. Materials whose shader\n already declares the tag (Unity's own shaders,
      cutout/transparent toon shader variants)\n are left untouched; the rest are
      detected from render queue, common keywords and URP\n surface properties, and
      swapped for tagged temporary copies."
