    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Gives the scene a unique file name for the duration of a bundle build,
      the same way every prefab\n build gets a unique prefab name.\n\n A scene bundle
      names its serialized files after the scene file (\"BuildPlayer-MyWorld\"),
      and Unity\n refuses to load two bundles that contain identically named files,
      so two worlds built from one\n scene can never both be loaded. Renaming rather
      than copying is deliberate: a rename keeps the\n scene's asset guid, and Unity
      keys baked rendering data off that guid. A copy gets a fresh guid,\n which
      silently unhooks the adaptive probe volume cell lookup on its baking set."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
