    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Quadric-error-metric edge-collapse simplifier for the far LOD generator.
      Avatar meshes are\n triangle soup (hair cards, cloth shells, accessories),
      so vertices are position-welded first\n to connect shells, boundary edges get
      penalty planes so open sheets keep their silhouette,\n and a grid-clustering
      fallback guarantees the triangle budget even when collapse quality\n checks
      refuse to go further. Bone attributes (2-influence, collapsed to humanoid bones)\n
      ride along by copying from the surviving endpoint nearest the collapse position."
    Remarks: 
