    Summary: "Dev tool: runs the real far avatar build on a scene avatar and shows
      the result \u2014 an\n interactive 3D view of the decoded far avatar, the baked
      atlas, payload stats and the\n per-stage generation log. The preview is constructed
      from the serialized \u2192 reparsed\n payload using the same builders the client
      runtime uses, so what you see is what a\n remote player would get.\n\n A scene
      copy is also spawned next to the source avatar; \"Mirror source pose\" drives
      it\n with the same `rest * delta` composition the networked bone job applies,
      so posing or\n animating the source live-validates skinning and the delta math.\n\n
      Lifetime: preview assets are HideAndDontSave (the editor destroys unflagged
      loose\n assets on scene/play transitions), and the payload is kept in SessionState
      so the\n window rebuilds itself after every domain reload instead of going
      blank."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
