    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Shows what Content Police will do to this content before anyone builds
      or uploads it.\n\n Enforcement is runtime-only: nothing in the build pipeline
      consults the allow-list, so without\n this an author finds out a component
      was stripped by loading the finished upload and noticing\n something missing.
      The same walk runs here against the same selector, in the editor, for free.\n\n
      Two outcomes are reported separately on purpose. A constraint is not \"disallowed\"
      \u2014 it is\n rewritten onto the Basis solver and keeps working, which is
      worth saying plainly so nobody\n removes it by hand thinking it is a problem."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
