    Summary: "Types marked with cilbox's [Cilboxable] are replaced by a CilboxProxy
      before the content is\n written, and that proxy is on the approved list, so
      the authored script never reaches the\n load-time pass and must not be reported
      against it. Resolved by name for the same reason the\n constraint list is:
      this assembly does not reference the cilbox package, which is optional."
