      a copy:\n a copy would lose the pipeline's per-camera data (post processing,
      renderer choice,\n background handling) and give an icon that doesn't match
      what players will see. Its render\n target and aspect are restored in a finally,
      so a failure mid-capture can't leave the\n scene's camera pointing at a texture."
