    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The shared Basis editor look, for IMGUI windows and inspectors.\n\n
      It mirrors the UI Toolkit identity used by the synced-pickup inspector and
      the video player\n windows: dark translucent rounded cards, a bold pink title,
      muted body text, pill-shaped status\n chips and flat accent buttons. Windows
      written with `OnGUI` can adopt it without being\n rewritten in UI Toolkit \u2014
      wrap the body in BeginPage/EndPage, put\n each block in a Card and use the
      row/pill/bar helpers instead of raw LabelFields."
    Remarks: 
