    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Serializes a config object with XmlSerializer and then injects\n human-readable
      XML comments before each element, so the generated/saved config\n files document
      themselves. Comments are written on every save (default-create and\n admin-panel
      save), so they persist across restarts and saves. Reads ignore comments.\n
      A config type with no registered docs is written exactly as XmlSerializer would."
    Remarks: 
