    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "How hard measured pressure may bend the resting split.\n\n Pressure
      is added to the resting weight rather than replacing it, so with no signal
      the\n allocator returns to the measured 1:3 default instead of inventing a
      split. At gain 4:\n both pools idle holds 25/75; the send loop saturated alone
      moves to 62/38; the peer pass\n saturated alone moves to 13/87. Enough authority
      to matter, not enough to strand a pool\n that happens to be briefly quiet."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
