    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Fraction of the whole machine this process is using, 0..1, over the
      last sample.\n\n This is the input every attempt at automatic sizing was missing.
      \"The pass is slow\" does\n not mean \"give it more workers\" \u2014 on a host
      that is already full, widening a pool only\n moves contention around, and measured
      at 2000 players on a saturated 32-thread box it\n cost 16.2 to 25.2 cores while
      leaving the pass just as slow. On a host with cores to\n spare the same widening
      is close to free. Utilisation is what separates those two, and\n it is the
      difference between a 32-thread box at 2000 players and a 128-core box at 4000."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
