    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Unreliable packets dropped because a peer's send queue was over budget
      \u2014 i.e. the server\n could not drain what it was producing and shed the
      oldest position updates instead of\n growing the backlog. Zero on a healthy
      instance; a rising number is the signal that the\n instance is past what it
      can deliver. Transports without a bounded queue report 0."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
