    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Ceiling on the scaled packet pool.\n\n The pool already grows at `perPeer`
      packets per connected peer; this is\n the wall it hits. The old fixed 262144
      was that wall from about 5400 peers upward, so at\n 8000 the pool was capped
      a third below what its own per-peer rule asked for and every\n recycle past
      the cap threw the packet away for the GC to re-allocate."
    Remarks: 
