    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Opus voice frame duration pushed to every client (20 or 40 ms). 20
      is the low-latency\n default; 40 halves the voice packet rate (25/s instead
      of 50/s) and with it the\n per-packet UDP/header overhead \u2014 roughly a
      third of voice wire cost \u2014 at the price of\n +20 ms voice latency. Admins
      can still change it live; this is only the boot default."
