  - TypeFullName: BasisNetworkServer.BasisNetworkHandleJiggleGrab
    MemberName: BasisNetworkHandleJiggleGrab
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Server-side relay for jiggle grab lifecycle events on\n BasisNetworkCommons.EventsChannel
      with sub-byte\n BasisNetworkCommons.EventType_JiggleGrab.\n\n The server never
      inspects avatar data: it rewrites the payload with the\n authenticated sender
      id, rate limits per peer, and fans out. Start (which is\n also the periodic
      keepalive) is relevance-filtered against the reduction\n system's player positions
      so a thousand concurrent grabs don't broadcast\n instance-wide; Stop and Deny
      are rare and broadcast so state can never leak."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
