    Summary: "Server-side router for session-scoped \"temp block\" notifications
      sent on\n BasisNetworkCommons.EventsChannel with sub-byte\n BasisNetworkCommons.EventType_PlayerTempBlock.\n\n
      Clients emit a temp-block message when a user toggles their local block on\n
      another player; the server rewrites the payload with the sender's peer id and\n
      forwards it to the target peer only, so the target can mirror the block on\n
      their client without the state being persisted on either end."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
