    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "A stamp and the two forms it is written in. The stamp has minute resolution,
      so building\n it per line spent a DateTime.Now \u2014 a timezone conversion
      \u2014 and two string allocations\n producing the same characters thousands
      of times over. Held as one immutable object\n swapped by reference so the minute
      and its text can never disagree; two threads racing\n here just compute the
      same value twice."
    Remarks: 
