    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Re-applies every setting that can take effect without a restart and
      pushes the new state to\n connected clients, so a runtime edit (console /config,
      admin panel) is live immediately.\n\n Deliberately not a re-run of StartServer's
      boot sequence: InitializeAuth builds a fresh\n BasisDIDAuthIdentity that subscribes
      to a static event and reloads permissions, allow and ban\n lists from disc,
      so calling it here would double-handle every auth packet and discard runtime\n
      moderation state. Only the password comparer is rebuilt. Bind-time settings
      are excluded and\n reported by Configuration.RequiresRestart."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
