  - TypeFullName: BasisServerTests.AvatarDeltaSavingsTests
    MemberName: AvatarDeltaSavingsTests
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Bandwidth-savings characterization at different levels of data similarity.
      Wire sizes model the\n common byte-id case:\n   keyframe wire = 1(id) + 1(interval)
      + 1(seq) + payload\n   delta wire    = 1(header) + 1(id) + 1(interval) + 1(seq)
      + 1(baseSeq) + deltaBody\n\n PrintSavingsTable also prints what the previous
      fixed-width delta codec would have\n spent on the same poses, which is the
      measurement that justifies the change: the two schemes agree\n when a field
      is untouched or fully re-randomized, and diverge exactly in the middle \u2014
      real motion,\n where a joint moves by a few quantization steps."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
