    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Replaces ComputeBitOffsets_MatchesRotationBytes_ForAllQualities, which
      pinned a helper that\n laid out all 51 bone slots as 2 + 3*bpc \u2014 the wire
      format until v47 moved the thirty finger\n joints to ten curl/splay channels.
      The helper had no callers but that test and the assertion\n was simply false
      (Medium: 78 bytes claimed against the real 52). Both are gone; this pins the\n
      same invariant against BuildRotationFieldOffsets, which is what the channel
      map actually uses."
