    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Raw setsockopt. Needed because .NET's Unix socket layer validates option
      names\n against its own mapping table instead of passing the value through,
      so an option it\n does not know \u2014 SO_REUSEPORT among them \u2014 is rejected
      with OperationNotSupported\n however it is cast. Going straight to libc is
      the only way to set it."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
