    Summary: "Sends up to `vlen` datagrams \u2014 each to its own destination \u2014
      in a\n single syscall. This is the whole point of the batch path: a broadcast
      server's\n cost is dominated by syscall count, not by bytes.\n Returns the
      number of messages sent, or -1."
