    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Enables SO_REUSEPORT on `socketHandle`, so several sockets can share
      one\n UDP port and the kernel hashes inbound 4-tuples across them. Must be
      set before bind.\n Returns false with `errno` set when the kernel refuses.\n\n
      Linux only \u2014 the caller checks the platform. It exists as a P/Invoke because
      the managed\n SetSocketOption cannot express this option at all; see UnixSock.setsockopt."
