  - TypeFullName: LiteNetLib.
    MemberName: PeerUpdateParallelism
    Kind: Field
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Worker cap for the per-peer update pass in UpdateLogic. 0 = scale with
      the\n peer count, which is what you want.\n\n This pass used to run on an uncapped
      Parallel.ForEach. At a few hundred passes a second\n that spread across every
      core the threadpool would give it \u2014 profiling a 500-player\n server found
      40 distinct threads in the pass, with three quarters of all GC-poll time\n
      coming from Parallel's own worker replication rather than from updating peers."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
