    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Ceiling for the auto-sized worker count.\n\n The host sets this, because
      this pool is not the only one on the machine \u2014 the server's\n reduction
      system runs an overlapping one, and sizing both against the core count\n oversubscribes
      the box (measured at 4000 players: 23.6 cores / 634 MB/s / 153 ms worst\n pass
      with both at full width, against 18.0 / 644 / 108 once they were given shares).\n
      Basis sets it from BasisCpuBudget. Standalone users who never assign it get
      three\n quarters of the box, which is the right answer when this is the only
      such pool."
    Remarks: 
