      payload traffic: the return value is optimistic (the datagram\n is queued,
      not yet on the wire), so callers that infer anything from it \u2014 MTU probing\n
      keys off a MessageSize failure, for instance \u2014 must keep using SendRaw.\n
      Falls through to the direct path whenever batching does not apply, so behaviour
