    Summary: "Reassembly sets an abandoned sender leaves behind used to live for
      the whole session \u2014\n up to MaxFragmentsInWindow x channels sets, each
      holding full NetPackets, per peer.\n Fragments of a live transfer keep arriving
      (reliable resend refreshes the stamp), so a\n set nothing has touched for this
      long can only belong to a sender that stopped\n mid-message; recycle it. Sweep
      is amortized to once per FragmentSweepIntervalMs."
