    Summary: "Generates realistic human-like avatar pose data for fake clients.\n
      Produces a natural standing pose (arms at sides, relaxed fingers, natural spine)\n
      with subtle idle animation (breathing, swaying, head micro-movements).\n\n
      Replaces the old zeroed-byte-array approach which produced T-pose avatars.\n
      Uses the same smallest-three quaternion compression as the real client."
