    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 5
    ParamNames:
    - dst
    - byteOffset
    - quality
    - timeSec
    - BasisBoneRotationCompression.GetBpcTable(quality
    ParamDocs:
    - Packet byte array.
    - Start of the rotation region (after position bytes).
    - Compression quality level.
    - Elapsed time in seconds (for animation).
    - Per-player phase offset (prevents synchronized animation).
