    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Slots the wire still carries as explicit rotations. Since v47 the thirty
      finger joints\n are no longer rotations at all \u2014 they are ten curl/splay
      channels, written by\n WriteFingerChannels. Walking all 51 BPC entries as if
      they were bones (as\n this generator used to) emits the pre-v47 1302-bit stream
      into a 896-bit region and\n overruns the packet's own tail."
    Remarks: 
