    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Voice range, derived from the server's own distance tiering instead
      of decoding positions.\n High and Medium avatar quality are only sent to peers
      inside MediumQualityDistance, which is\n the voice radius, so receiving that
      tier is proof the sender is close enough to hear. Lower\n tiers are ignored:
      those players are either far away or being quality-shed, and in both\n cases
      they should not be added as voice recipients.\n The player id is read straight
      out of the buffer so the reader stays untouched for the\n sniffing paths that
      run after this."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
