  - TypeFullName: Basis.Network.
    MemberName: Volatile.Read
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - _chorusUntilMs
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Independent per-person bursts produce a smooth, low concurrency that
      never spikes \u2014 but\n crowds are correlated. Everyone sings happy birthday,
      cheers, or laughs at the same\n moment, and that simultaneous peak is the load
      the server actually has to survive; a\n model that only ever produces the quiet
      average never tests it. Baseline conversation\n is punctuated by chorus events
      where most of the crowd talks at once."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
