  - TypeFullName: Basis.Network.
    MemberName: Initialize
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - clientCount
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Real Opus rather than random bytes. Random payloads are the wrong size
      distribution\n (Opus is VBR) and, more importantly, are undecodable \u2014
      a real player joining the load\n test would get decoder errors instead of audio.
      A sine sweep encoded once at startup\n gives frames that decode to an audible
      tone and vary in size the way speech does; the\n frames are shared by every
      simulated client because the encoder is the expensive part\n and the bytes
      on the wire are what the server is being measured on."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
