    Summary: "Every voice participant transmits the single shared capture, so a listener
      hears real\n audio from whichever bots are inside VoiceRangeMeters of them
      rather than having to find\n one designated speaker. Range culling and the
      talk/silence burst clock are untouched, so\n the crowd load profile is the
      same as a synthetic run."
