    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Called when avatar traffic arrives about `playerId` at a quality tier\n
      the server only sends to nearby peers.\n\n This is how a real player joining
      gets heard. Rather than decoding positions, it reuses\n the distance work the
      SERVER already did: High/Medium avatar quality is only sent inside\n MediumQualityDistance,
      which is the voice radius, so simply receiving that tier proves\n the sender
      is in range. It also tracks people moving, and needs no special case for\n
      real players \u2014 they announce themselves by being audible."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
