      and the quality\n ladder. The actual bone-rotation bitstream is produced by
      BasisBoneRotationCompression;\n the size helpers here delegate to it. (The
      legacy per-muscle quantization tables that used to\n live here were removed
      \u2014 the smallest-three quaternion codec superseded them.)"
