    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 1
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Per-axis \xB11 m envelope. At 13 bits that is \u22480.24 mm/axis \u2014
      six times finer than the\n 1.5 mm hips-delta deadband that already decides
      what is worth sending, and large\n enough to cover squat/seated overrides without
      clipping. (The previous int16 form\n spent 30 \xB5m/axis, fifty times finer
      than the deadband it was measured against.)"
    Remarks: 
