    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Buffer size TryFlatten can require for a grouped body of\n `groupedLength`
      bytes.\n\n Flattening costs 3 bytes of framing per entry against the grouped
      form's 2, so it can\n only grow. Every entry occupies at least 3 bytes when
      grouped (2 length + 1 body), so\n there are at most groupedLength/3 entries
      and the flat form is at most 2x the input."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
