  - TypeFullName: Basis.Network.Core.Compression.BasisAvatarChannelMap
    MemberName: BasisAvatarChannelMap
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Builds the per-quality channel decomposition of an avatar payload.\n\n
      Payload geometry (see BasisAvatarBitPacking / BasisBoneRotationCompression):\n  
      [position      9 B]  3 x signed int24 millimetres, byte-aligned little-endian\n  
      [rotation    var B]  bit-packed LSB-first: 21 bone slots (2-bit largest index
      + 3 x BPC\n                        components) then 10 finger channels (curl
      + splay), then padding\n   [scale         2 B]  posit16\n   [body rot     
      7 B]  1 B largest index + 3 x uint16\n   [hips delta    5 B]  3 x signed 13-bit
      + 1 spare bit\n   [hips rot      7 B]  1 B largest index + 3 x uint16\n   [effectors   
      35 B]  High only: 8-bit mask + 4 x (3 x 12-bit position, 2-bit index, 3 x 10-bit
      rotation)\n\n Field indices match BasisAvatarDeltaCompression's dirty-mask
      fields exactly, so\n the mask's meaning is unchanged from the verbatim-copy
      codec that preceded this."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
