      is 2/255 \u2248 0.0078,\n so this suppresses only movement the wire could not
      have expressed. Fingers are cheap\n since v47 and a still hand is already gated
      by every other field, so there is nothing to\n buy by going wider \u2014 and
      going wider would show as lag on a slow deliberate curl."
