  - TypeFullName: ClientBodyFitMessage
    MemberName: ClientBodyFitMessage
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "A body-fit change with no avatar change behind it \u2014 the common
      case, since recalibrating or\n nudging the fit sliders resizes segments without
      touching which avatar is worn. Sent on\n AvatarChangeMessageChannel under AvatarChangeKind.BodyFit;
      the server merges it into the stored\n ClientAvatarChangeMessage so late joiners
      still receive it as part of one record. Kept separate\n from the full message
      so this path never re-sends the avatar bytes and, critically, so receivers\n
      never run their avatar-reload path for what is only a proportion tweak."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
