    Summary: "Record a batch of N outbound messages on the same `index`. Caller\n
      is expected to have accumulated `count` messages totaling\n `bytesEncoded`
      bytes within one logical scope (e.g. one receiver's\n tick in the BSR send
      loop). Folds N\xD7(LOCK XADD + LOCK ADD) into 2\xD7LOCK ADD \u2014\n at 1k+
      players this is several percent of total CPU saved in the BSR hot path."
