  - TypeFullName: Basis.Network.Server.Generic.BasisNetworkImageCache+CachedImage
    MemberName: CachedImage
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 1
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Server \u2192 owner: \"I am holding this image\" / \"I am no longer
      holding it\". The owner skips\n re-sending held images to each arrival, which
      is the whole point of the buffer. Sent only\n to the owner and stamped with
      their own player id \u2014 the relay never echoes a sender to\n itself, so
      a message arriving under your own id cannot have come from another client."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
