    Summary: "Dedicated tick loop on its own thread. Targets ~250Hz (4ms) while players
      are\n connected and parks (~0% CPU) when the server is empty. The inter-tick
      wait uses\n AutoResetEvent.WaitOne so an idle or under-budget loop never burns
      a core; the OS\n timer is raised to 1ms (Windows) so the wait keeps ~4ms accuracy."
