    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Runtime-only \"rejoin-only\" lockdown. While the restriction mode is\n
      BasisNetworkCore.Security.BasisUserRestrictionMode.RejoinOnly, only the UUIDs\n
      captured at the moment the mode was enabled may (re)connect \u2014 nobody new.
      The set persists\n through disconnects (so a captured player can leave and
      rejoin) and never grows. It is not\n persisted to disk; a restart normalizes
      the mode back to Normal and the set starts empty."
