  - TypeFullName: BasisNetworkServer.Security.BasisServerLogBundleService
    MemberName: BasisServerLogBundleService
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Builds a single compressed bundle of the server's logs/ and CrashReports/
      folders on\n demand and streams it back to the requesting admin over\n BasisNetworkCommons.AdminChannel.\n\n
      The files are packed into one length-prefixed container, LZ4-compressed (the
      same\n codec already used for avatar bundles, so no new dependency), and split
      into ordered\n chunks (ChunkSize) so a large transfer never depends on one
      oversized\n datagram. The admin channel is ReliableOrdered, so the client reassembles
      them in\n send order. The whole build + send runs off the network thread, and
      each chunk uses a\n fresh NetDataWriter (no shared pool) to stay thread-safe.\n\n
      Container (before compression):\n   [int fileCount] then per file: [string
      relativePath][int byteLength][bytes]\n\n Wire (server\u2192client), all on
      AdminChannel, ReliableOrdered:\n   LogBundleBegin : [string serverNameSafe][string
      fileName][bool isCompressed][int payloadBytes][int rawBytes][int totalChunks]\n  
      LogBundleChunk : [int chunkIndex][lenPrefixed bytes]   (repeated totalChunks
      times, payload stream)\n   LogBundleEnd   : [bool ok][string message]\n\n Gated
      upstream by PermNodes.AdminLogs in BasisPlayerModeration."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
