    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Get from one mesh and set on another in a single pass. Shapes are matched
      by index,\n which is exact when the target is a clone of the source (shared
      Mesh); if the two\n disagree on shape count the lower count wins.\n\n Prefer
      this over GetWeights followed by SetWeights whenever\n you are not modifying
      the weights in between \u2014 it skips the intermediate array\n entirely. `epsilon`
      works as it does on SetWeights: at\n or below 0 every shape is written, above
      0 the destination is read back and unchanged\n shapes are left alone."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: How many shapes were considered.
