    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Index of the rig whose root bone has this name, or -1. Resolve the
      chains you care about\n once in `Start` and compare against them in the callbacks
      \u2014 hierarchy order is stable\n for a given object, but an index hard-coded
      against one avatar means nothing on another.\n ```\n\n int tail;\n void Start()
      { GetComponent<BasisJiggleEventShim>(); tail = GetComponent<BasisJiggleEventShim>().FindJiggleRig(
      \"Tail\" ); }\n void OnJiggleTouch( int playerId, bool began, int hand, int
      rigIndex )\n {\n     if( rigIndex == tail && began ) { /* react */ }\n }\n
      \n```"
