    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Bind (or re-bind) the transform pairs the automatic tick mirrors: target[i]
      takes\n source[i]'s state each frame, per Channels and Space.\n Arrays are
      COPIED, so the caller may rebuild or drop its own freely. Pairing is by\n index
      and the shorter length wins. Passing empty or null arrays unbinds.\n\n You
      do not need to bind to use GetValues, SetValues or\n CopyValues \u2014 those
      are static and take whatever arrays you hand them.\n Binding buys you the automatic
      per-frame tick and the lifetime cleanup, nothing else."
    Remarks: 
