      do, in the order\n someone writing one needs it.\n\n \n\nOnly the prose is
      written here. Whether an entry is available in a given box is asked\n of that
      box at draw time through CilboxApiEntry.AvailableIn, so an entry cannot\n keep
      claiming a capability after the whitelist behind it is edited away."
