    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The compiled state of the three Cilbox sandboxes, read straight off
      the loaded assembly.\n\n \n\nEverything shown in the window comes from here
      rather than from parsed text, and every\n verdict is produced by calling the
      box's own check methods. That is deliberate: a permissions\n UI that reports
      its own opinion of the rules is worse than none, because the one failure it\n
      hides is \"the window said allowed and the sandbox said no\"."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
