    Summary: "Takes a script and reports what the sandbox will refuse, with the fix
      one click away.\n\n \n\nThe other tabs answer \"what is allowed?\"; this one
      answers \"will this work?\", which is\n the question people actually arrive
      with. Everything shown comes from the compiled IL of the\n script's method
      bodies, so it reflects what the code calls rather than what it declares."
