    Summary: "Networked vehicle built on BasisSyncedTransform: the body transform
      plus per-wheel\n spin, per-steer angle, engine revs and steer ratio are synced
      as typed fields and interpolated by\n the central sync engine. The local pilot
      (seat occupant) takes ownership and drives the physics;\n every other client
      interpolates the body + visuals."
